  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kosti Pastoral Region - Community Development Office (CDO) relocation to Renk</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a 1-year project aimed at facilitating the relocation and establishment of the Kosti Pastoral Region&#x2019;s Community Development Office (CDO) from Kosti in Sudan to Renk in South Sudan. With the current CDO office located in Kosti in Sudan coordination and supervision of programme activities as well as engagement with CAFOD the only Caritas partner actively working in Northern Upper Nile in the parishes of Renk and Maban has not been possible due to the political tensions between the two countries that led to the closure of border between Sudan and South Sudan. The present situation has incapacitated the CDO Office to effectively plan, implement and manage projects/programmes. The proposed transfer of the said parishes to Malakal diocese located in South Sudan has also been hampered by the on-going political tensions as well as the lack of adequate clergy and skilled lay manpower. This has led to CAFOD becoming semi operational in order to reach out and provide services to the needy refugees and host communities consisting mainly of returnees.</narrative>
  </description>
